      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIENNA ON SHOW (6) was strongly fancied and drifted back but wound up hard to hit the frame, 4 lengths from the winner (24.53) at this track in Grade 5. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. TOKYO ROMANCE (1) was out of placings last time (22.51) at Shepparton in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Has three wins already from this draw. Looks a key chance on best figures. DR. NAKITA (3) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at Sale over 435m behind Lakeview Tracker (25.09) in a Mix 6/7. Was a winner the start prior. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. RED EYE SAMURAI (2) is new to this circuit but cannot be left out.",
